In this case, we've developed
an application which, just

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.360
heads up, this is in our beta.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.950
So it's in one store.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:07.670
So if those of you are
Discount Tire customers,

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:11.330
