00:12:13.735 --> 00:12:15.110
Because most of
you know you have

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:16.700
to train that bot
so that it becomes

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:22.540
proficient in various types
of call outs and sequences.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.150
Because we're leveraging
Google's back end,

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:30.730
we were able to then leverage
the location services,

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:35.500
the maps, the APIs that
exist, and pull that

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:40.210
in from Discount Tire's APIs
and also then connect it

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.450
to their appointment and
calendaring system that

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.170
exists in their store.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:48.910
So what you'll see is that
we're able to then make

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.100
that callout in the
Google device that

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:57.370
goes to the cloud, of course,
connects via the API gateway

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:00.880
into Discount Tire's store.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.830
And then it sets the
appointment not only

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.950
in your Google Calendar,
but also at the store.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:12.090
So I'm going to ask John to come
up here and show that to you.

