You can complete
the session survey

00:46:18.710 --> 00:46:21.950
in your app and leave notes.

00:46:21.950 --> 00:46:26.720
I get to see at least the
summary information and any

00:46:26.720 --> 00:46:28.000
of those comments.

00:46:28.000 --> 00:46:30.093
So if we did something
particularly great,

00:46:30.093 --> 00:46:32.510
or if you wish this session
was about something completely

